ize_histogram_reservoir` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +173 / -61 across 8 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: —  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.40.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Discussion (9)\\n\\n**codecov[bot]** — 2025-10-02T13:58:33Z\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-05]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Optimize histogram reservoir (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7443)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7443  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-02T13:56:40Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-15T15:00:11Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-12-15T14:59:34Z)  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"syncmeasur noview exemplarsen float64histogram attribut 0 24 431 0n 2 116 3n 273 01 p 0 002 n 6 syncmeasur noview exemplarsen float64histogram attribut 1024 470 9n 1 171 0n 5 63 70 p 0 002 n 6 i explor use a atom pointer measur but this had similar perform while be much more complex need a sync pool to elimin alloc the singl thread perform wa also much wors for that solut see http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go compar main dashpol optim _ histogram _ reservoir _ old sourc id src pr 05 pull request optim histogram reservoir open telemetri opentelemetri go 7443 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7443 author dashpol creat 2025 10 02t13 56 40z updat 2025 12 15t15 00 11z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 12 15t14 59 34z branch optim _ histogram _ reservoir main chang 173 61 across 8 file label mileston v1 400 discuss 9 codecov bot 2025 10 02t13 58 33z sourc id src pr 05 pull request optim histogram reservoir open telemetri opentelemetri go 7443 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7443 author dashpol creat 2025 10 02t13 56 40z updat 2025 12 15t15 00 11z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 12 15t14 59 34z\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8757264a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"id\": \"bd4cf3022c233cd4\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.35571440157801765, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15540021939716805, \"vector_similarity\": 0.82311416, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8757264a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 20034, \"chunk_count\": 14, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:06\", \"token_count\": 7244, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Two non-observability items noted:\\n\\n  - Sync map / atomics for fixed bucket histograms.\\n\\n  - Exemplar reservoir changes.\\n\\n- Safe to slip to next release; include if ready.\\n\\n### 4. Stabilizing new attribute value types\\n\\n- Discussion about stabilizing new spec attribute types (byte arrays, “any” type).\\n\\n- Prototype implementation exists and needs review.\\n\\n- Considered tricky; careful review needed around limits and types.\\n\\n### 5. Processor `Enabled` method\\n\\n- Proposal from Robert to move `Enabled` from filter processor to main processor interface.\\n\\n- Spec now stabilized and allows this.\\n\\n- Pros: consistent API, less ad-hoc type assertion/boilerplate in docs.\\n\\n- Con: processors that are “always enabled” need a trivial `Enabled() bool { return true }`.\\n\\n- General agreement; will revisit for final confirmation.\\n\\n### 6. OTLP `insecure` support (logs, env vars, spec)\\n\\n- PR adds `insecure` (env var) support for OTLP **logs**, matching traces/metrics.\\n\\n- HTTP OTLP config historically messy; env vars common in practice.\\n\\n- Spec unclear due to moratorium on env vars.\\n\\n- Direction: add logs support in Go; push for spec clarity later.\\n\\n### 7. Collector protobuf changes & PDataGen\\n\\n- Collector removed dependency on Go protobuf types; now uses `pdataGen`.\\n\\n- Large internal rewrite; significant line count reduction.\\n\\n- Benchmarks improved (fewer allocations).\\n\\n- Some cross-language quirks surfaced but manageable.\\n\\n- Go SIG interested in exploring similar approaches; needs more benchmarking.\\n\\n### 8. KubeCon & talks\\n\\n- First SIG meeting since KubeCon.\\n\\n- Members encouraged to share notable talks and videos once available.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n- Merge OTelConf RC support PR as-is (pending normal review).\\n\\n- Track experimental API structure review (e.g., `x` submodule) under the `1.40.0` milestone.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"two non observ item note sync map atom for fix bucket histogram exemplar reservoir chang safe to slip to next releas includ if readi 4 stabil new attribut valu type discuss about stabil new spec attribut type byte array ani type prototyp implement exist and need review consid tricki care review need around limit and type 5 processor enabl method propos from robert to move enabl from filter processor to main processor interfac spec now stabil and allow this pro consist api less ad hoc type assert boilerpl in doc con processor that are alway enabl need a trivial enabl bool return true general agreement will revisit for final confirm 6 otlp insecur support log env var spec pr add insecur env var support for otlp log match trace metric http otlp config histor messi env var common in practic spec unclear due to moratorium on env var direct add log support in go push for spec clariti later 7 collector protobuf chang pdatagen collector remov depend on go protobuf type now us pdatagen larg intern rewrit signific line count reduct benchmark improv fewer alloc some cross languag quirk surfac but manag go sig interest in explor similar approach need more benchmark 8 kubecon talk first sig meet sinc kubecon member encourag to share notabl talk and video onc avail sourc id src note 07 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 26 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3581463689 author pellar creat 2025 11 26t14 02 28z updat 2025 11 26t16 36 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 20 decis merg otelconf rc support pr ais pend normal review track experiment api structur review e g x submodul under the 140 0 mileston\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874202ba8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"id\": \"2174523acdce943d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.348207455094692, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.16204147584956, \"vector_similarity\": 0.78259474, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874202ba8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3959, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:22\", \"token_count\": 1379, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-PR-05]\\n\\n# Pull Request: Optimize histogram reservoir (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go#7443)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7443  \\n\\n**Author**: dashpole  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-02T13:56:40Z · **Updated**: 2025-12-15T15:00:11Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: merged (2025-12-15T14:59:34Z)  \\n\\n**Branch**: `optimize_histogram_reservoir` → `main`  \\n\\n**Changes**: +173 / -61 across 8 files  \\n\\n**Labels**: —  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.40.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThis improves the concurrent performance of the histogram reservoir's Offer function by 4x (i.e. 75% reduction).\\n\\nAccomplish this by locking each measurement, rather than locking around the entire storage.  Also, defer extracting the trace context from context.Context until collection time. This improves the performance of Offer, which is on the measure hot path.  Exemplars are often overwritten, so deferring the operation until Collect reduces the overall work.\\n\\n```\\n\\n                           │   main.txt   │              hist.txt              │\\n\\n                           │    sec/op    │   sec/op     vs base               │\\n\\nFixedSizeReservoirOffer-24    211.4n ± 3%   177.5n ± 3%  -16.04% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\\nHistogramReservoirOffer-24   200.85n ± 2%   47.41n ± 2%  -76.40% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\\ngeomean                       206.1n        91.73n       -55.48%\\n\\n```\\n\\nBenchmarks for Measure:\\n\\n```\\n\\n                                                                                 │  main.txt   │             histres.txt             │\\n\\n                                                                                 │   sec/op    │    sec/op     vs base               │\\n\\nSyncMeasure/NoView/ExemplarsEnabled/Int64Histogram/Attributes/0-24                 436.7n ± 4%   114.8n ±  5%  -73.72% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\\nSyncMeasure/NoView/ExemplarsEnabled/Int64Histogram/Attributes/10-24                472.2n ± 2%   169.7n ±  8%  -64.08% (p=0.002 n=6)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src pr 05 pull request optim histogram reservoir open telemetri opentelemetri go 7443 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7443 author dashpol creat 2025 10 02t13 56 40z updat 2025 12 15t15 00 11z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state merg 2025 12 15t14 59 34z branch optim _ histogram _ reservoir main chang 173 61 across 8 file label mileston v1 400 descript this improv the concurr perform of the histogram reservoir s offer function by 4x i e 75 reduct accomplish this by lock each measur rather than lock around the entir storag also defer extract the trace context from context context until collect time this improv the perform of offer which is on the measur hot path exemplar are often overwritten so defer the oper until collect reduc the overal work main txt hist txt sec op sec op v base fixedsizereservoiroff 24 211 4n 3 177 5n 316 04 p 0 002 n 6 histogramreservoiroff 24 200 85n 247 41n 2 76 40 p 0 002 n 6 geomean 206 1n 91 73n 55 48 benchmark for measur main txt histr txt sec op sec op v base syncmeasur noview exemplarsen int64histogram attribut 0 24 436 7n 4 114 8n 5 73 72 p 0 002 n 6 syncmeasur noview exemplarsen int64histogram attribut 1024 472 2n 2 169 7n 8 64 08 p 0 002 n 6\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8757264a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"id\": \"bcdaee6c0a13a293\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3461655641510407, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.14564846307291535, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8140388, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-7443.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8757264a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", 